A||||3||TN Fieros||December Meet- Trip to Fiero Factory||||1||
Z||000000||TN Fieros||11-18-2001||08:19 PM||||For our December meeting, the TN Fiero Owners are taking a road trip down to Ed Parks' Fiero Factory.<P>We will be leaving Nashville around 8:30am on December 8. Fiero Factory's Saturday hours are 10-2 so we want to be able to have as long there as possible.<P>If anyone wants to meet us in Nashville and convoy down, we will meet at Rivergate Mall. If you don't live in Nashville and just want to meet us there, we look forward to seeing you there.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TNFiero[1].gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000001||TN Fieros||12-01-2001||02:40 PM||||It's next weekend! Who is planning to make this trip with us?<P>Ed Parks and the guys from the Fiero Factory are convoying back to Nashville with us Saturday afternoon. They are visiting the Opryland Hotel and Opry Mills. <P>Hope to see some new faces there. Write to tnfieros@home.com for more info.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TNFiero[1].gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000002||ironhedno3||12-02-2001||05:41 PM||||well dale as you know i will be there..hopefully anyone else who considers themselves a member of our little club will show up this time.its a week away and we mentioned it a few weeks back so perhaps we will have a good turnout...if not i guess they weren't too serious to begin with...keith||||reg||6
Z||000003||TN Fieros||12-08-2001||05:54 PM||||Good turnout today and lots of fun - even though it did rain on us all the way! Lots of tech talk, dreaming, planning, etc... Thanks for hosting us, Ed...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TNFiero[1].gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
